include media

mixin specList()
    dl(class='space-y-5')
        each row in [1, 2, 3]
            div(class='flex justify-between gap-5 border-b border-line pb-5 text-lg')
                dt(class='font-medium text-ink') Weight
                dd 12 kg

section(class='js-tabs wrapper py-10')
    div(class='flex flex-col justify-around gap-5 border-b border-line py-5 text-center text-h3 tablet:flex-row', role='tablist', aria-label='Product details')
        button(
            id='tab-description',
            class='border-b-2 border-brand pb-2 text-brand transition-colors hover:text-brand',
            type='button',
            role='tab',
            aria-selected='true',
            aria-controls='panel-description',
            tabindex='0'
        ) Description
        button(
            id='tab-additional',
            class='border-b-2 border-transparent pb-2 text-ink transition-colors hover:text-brand',
            type='button',
            role='tab',
            aria-selected='false',
            aria-controls='panel-additional',
            tabindex='-1'
        ) Additional information
        button(
            id='tab-reviews',
            class='border-b-2 border-transparent pb-2 text-ink transition-colors hover:text-brand',
            type='button',
            role='tab',
            aria-selected='false',
            aria-controls='panel-reviews',
            tabindex='-1'
        ) Reviews (3)

    div(
        id='panel-description',
        class='mt-7 grid items-center gap-10 rounded-card border border-line p-5 tablet:grid-cols-2 tablet:p-12',
        role='tabpanel',
        aria-labelledby='tab-description',
        tabindex='0'
    )
        div
            h2(class='mb-5 text-h3 font-normal text-ink') Description
            p Quidem eveniet quod veritatis non. Dolore voluptas quod cumque sunt quia facere voluptas. Omnis nihil ad quia de bitis voluptatems of unique wholesale brand quidem eveniet quod veritatis non dolore voluptas quod cumque in.
        img(class='aspect-4/3 w-full rounded-card object-cover', src='/src/assets/images/box-description/description.webp', alt='', width='940', height='736', loading='lazy')

    div(
        id='panel-additional',
        class='mt-7 grid gap-10 rounded-card border border-line p-5 tablet:grid-cols-2 tablet:p-12',
        role='tabpanel',
        aria-labelledby='tab-additional',
        tabindex='0',
        hidden
    )
        +specList()
        +specList()

    div(
        id='panel-reviews',
        class='mt-7 rounded-card border border-line p-5 tablet:p-12',
        role='tabpanel',
        aria-labelledby='tab-reviews',
        tabindex='0',
        hidden
    )
        h2(class='mb-5 text-h3 font-normal text-ink') Customer Reviews
        p(class='text-ink-soft') There are no reviews yet for this product.

